// WRONG: bidirectional pair, but @OneToMany has no mappedBy
@Entity
class Department {
    @Id @GeneratedValue private Long id;

    @OneToMany // no mappedBy -> Hibernate adds an EXTRA join table
    private List<Employee> employees = new ArrayList<>();
}

@Entity
class Employee {
    @Id @GeneratedValue private Long id;

    @ManyToOne
    @JoinColumn(name = "department_id") // this FK already models the link
    private Department department;
}
// Result: employee.department_id AND a department_employees join table.
```
One logical link ends up stored twice, so inserts and updates fight each other.

